          "eyebrow": "Our Four Pillars",
          "headline": "How We Think About Doing Better",
          "subheadline": "Every sustainability decision at Lumi & Bloom runs through these four lenses.",
          "body": null,
          "items": [
            {
              "title": "Clean Formulation",
              "description": "We source only responsibly harvested, sustainably farmed botanical ingredients. No petrochemical derivatives. Full supply chain transparency.",
              "metadata": {}
            },
            {
              "title": "Circular Packaging",
              "description": "We use post-consumer recycled plastics, glass, and aluminum. Our refill program lets customers return empties for a discount on their next order.",
              "metadata": {}
            },
            {
              "title": "Climate Responsibility",
              "description": "All operations and shipping are carbon offset. We publish our annual carbon footprint report so you can hold us accountable.",
              "metadata": {}
            },
